<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Lars Alexandersson is Heihachi Mishima's illegitimate child and the leader of the rebel army fighting against G Corp. A former officer of the Mishima Zaibatsu's special military unit known as the Tekken Force, Lars led a coup d'état against the Zaibatsu and took many of the Tekken Force personnel with him.

Right click selected key for the macro &gt; Operating mode &gt; Run while you hold the key
^
This has to be done since Lars is heavy on minus if opponent blocks the 6th hit, so release early if you think opponent is gonna turtle / keep blocking

Movement:   Combat:
W                J = 1  
A                 I = 2
S                 K = 3
D                 L = 4

Macro created &amp; tested in ranked 24/02/2024 - Extra buffer input added so it still works with lag as long as it doesn't go below 3 bars.

Youtube video with demonstration:

https://youtu.be/bNzE3se0mRI</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
